 sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Polvo guisado \u00e0 moda da Lagoa, Lapas grelhadas e Licores artesanais de frutos locais.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 7. FAQS --><\/p>\n<section class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: left;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n    Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">D\u00favidas habituais sobre a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lagoa 2026.<\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-grid\">\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n<p>Os resultados oficiais ficam dispon\u00edveis na plataforma Lap2Go e no Portugal Running.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso ver as fotografias do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n<p>As fotos s\u00e3o partilhadas na Lap2Go e redes sociais do CDOL.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL --><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51701,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"